title: Controlled Message Replacements Uncover Latent Communication Effects in LLMs
url: http://arxiv.org/abs/2607.26773v1
utility_score: 9
why_read: Read this to understand a new causal audit method for evaluating latent
  communication in LLM multi-agent systems. You will learn why end-task performance
